<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2604307454"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1755152294"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="LOVE 2000"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="遠野ひかる"/><amll:meta key="album" value="LOVE 2000"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:25.950"><div begin="00:21.900" end="04:14.820"><p begin="00:21.900" end="00:27.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">愛はどこからやってくるのでしょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ha</span></p><p begin="00:27.350" end="00:33.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">自分の胸に問いかけた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我询问着自己的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n no mu ne ni to i ka ke ta</span></p><p begin="00:33.080" end="00:38.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">ニセモノなんか興味はないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对虚假之物毫无兴趣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni se mo no na n ka kyo u mi ha na i no</span></p><p begin="00:38.700" end="00:45.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">ホントだけを見つめたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只想寻觅真实的存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to da ke wo mi tsu me ta i</span></p><p begin="00:56.690" end="01:02.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">悲しい NEWSと どうでもいい話<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悲伤的新闻 无关紧要的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na shi i news to do u de mo i i ha na shi</span></p><p begin="01:02.320" end="01:08.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">朝からもうそんなのうんざりで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从清晨开始就对那些感到厌倦了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a sa ka ra mo u so n na no u n za ri de</span></p><p begin="01:08.000" end="01:10.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">今日はいつもよりも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天的风比平时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u ha i tsu mo yo ri mo</span></p><p begin="01:10.940" end="01:13.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">風が気持ちイイからネ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉更舒适宜人呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga ki mo chi i i ka ra ne</span></p><p begin="01:13.670" end="01:18.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">楽しさに着替えてネ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心情也变得愉悦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta no shi sa ni ki ga e te ne</span></p><p begin="01:18.240" end="01:21.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">気づけなかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从来都不曾察觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki du ke na ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:21.080" end="01:23.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">きっと甘えてたのかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一定一直都在撒娇吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to a ma e te ta no ka na</span></p><p begin="01:23.850" end="01:28.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">だから自分愛して人を愛して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我要爱我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra ji bu n a i shi te</span></p><p begin="01:28.700" end="01:29.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">みたいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想一直以来都在不断膨胀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me ha i tsu de mo fu ku ra mu ba ka ri de</span></p><p begin="01:29.550" end="01:35.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">夢はいつでも膨らむばかりで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想总是不断膨胀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me ha i tsu de mo fu ku ra mu ba ka ri de</span></p><p begin="01:35.190" end="01:40.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">誰かの思いを無視してた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我忽视了他人的感受</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re ka no o mo i wo mu shi shi te ta</span></p><p begin="01:40.840" end="01:46.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">きっといつかはわかってるのかナ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许我终有一天一定可以明白吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to i tsu ka ha wa ka 't te ru no ka na</span></p><p begin="01:46.460" end="01:53.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">手放した風船飛んでった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经松手的气球都已飞走</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te ba na shi ta fu u se n to n de 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:53.370" end="01:55.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">サバよんでみたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕虚报了年龄</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ba yo n de mi ta 't te</span></p><p begin="01:55.990" end="01:58.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">あの頃に戻れやしないし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也无法再回到当初了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ko ro ni mo do re ya shi na i shi</span></p><p begin="01:58.790" end="02:04.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">だから今を認めていたいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我想接纳承认当下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra i ma wo mi to me te i ta i no</span></p><p begin="02:04.430" end="02:07.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">とても大切な事も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕在曾经</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to te mo ta i se tsu na ko to mo</span></p><p begin="02:07.260" end="02:10.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">見過ごしちゃったとしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">错过了无比重要的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi su go shi cha 't ta to shi te mo</span></p><p begin="02:10.050" end="02:14.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">また見つければイイ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要再将其找寻就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta mi tsu ke re ba i i</span></p><p begin="02:14.750" end="02:17.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">いつも言ってたネ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像常说的那样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo i 't te ta ne</span></p><p begin="02:17.540" end="02:20.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">"まァ どうにかなるって"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“没关系 一切都会有办法”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ ma do u ni ka na ru 't te ”</span></p><p begin="02:20.310" end="02:22.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">だけど力まかせじゃ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但也会有哪怕竭尽全力</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do chi ka ra ma ka se ja</span></p><p begin="02:22.820" end="02:26.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">どうにもならない事もアル<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后终究还是事与愿违的事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ni mo na ra na i ko to mo a ru</span></p><p begin="02:26.060" end="02:31.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">愛はどこからやってくるのでしょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ha</span></p><p begin="02:31.510" end="02:37.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">自分の胸に問いかけた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我询问着自己的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n no mu ne ni to i ka ke ta</span></p><p begin="02:37.280" end="02:42.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">少しずつだけどいろんな事が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然只有些许而已但很多事情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi zu tsu da ke do i ro n na ko to ga</span></p><p begin="02:42.860" end="02:49.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">変わって 私はここにアル<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都已改变 才会有此刻的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa 't te wa ta shi ha ko ko ni a ru</span></p><p begin="03:01.020" end="03:03.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">こんなハズじゃなかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切原本不该这样发展</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ha zu ja na ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:03.760" end="03:06.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">とんだオトギ話<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不可思议的童话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to n da o to gi ba na shi</span></p><p begin="03:06.630" end="03:12.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">なぞなぞみたいな 愛す事の意味は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人难以琢磨的爱都有何意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na zo na zo mi ta i na a i su ko to no i mi ha</span></p><p begin="03:12.280" end="03:14.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">運命だけじゃなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不仅仅是命运使然</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u n me i da ke ja na ku te</span></p><p begin="03:14.980" end="03:17.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">センチメンタルでもなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也并非源于那份多愁善感</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se n chi me n ta ru de mo na ku te</span></p><p begin="03:17.830" end="03:22.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">強く見えないモノかナ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许它看起来本就虚幻脆弱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ku mi e na i mo no ka na</span></p><p begin="03:22.560" end="03:28.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">愛はどこからやってくるのでしょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ha</span></p><p begin="03:28.090" end="03:33.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">自分の胸に問いかけた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我询问着自己的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n no mu ne ni to i ka ke ta</span></p><p begin="03:33.770" end="03:39.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">食べてみなくちゃわからない事<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有切实地感受过之后才能够明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta be te mi na ku cha wa ka ra na i ko to</span></p><p begin="03:39.400" end="03:45.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">出会いの引力はどれほどか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人的相遇需要多强大的引力</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de a i no i n ryo ku ha do re ho do ka</span></p><p begin="03:45.140" end="03:50.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">愛はどこからやってくるのでしょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ha</span></p><p begin="03:50.660" end="03:56.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">自分の胸に問いかけた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我询问着自己的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n no mu ne ni to i ka ke ta</span></p><p begin="03:56.310" end="04:02.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">ニセモノなんか興味はないワ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对虚假之物毫无兴趣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni se mo no na n ka kyo u mi ha na i wa</span></p><p begin="04:02.030" end="04:07.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">ホンモノだけ見つけたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只想寻觅真实的存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n mo no da ke mi tsu ke ta i</span></p><p begin="04:07.710" end="04:14.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">あなたをずっと探してた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直都在找寻着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wo zu 't to sa ga shi te ta</span></p></div></body></tt>